OL,3,GNEWSA'Cliffs are enemy not the sea' for
OL,4,Arailway says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FFresh concerns have been raised about
OL,7,Frail services out of Devon and
OL,8,FCornwall, with MPs warning crumbling
OL,9,Fcliffs could block the track.
OL,11,FA storm destroyed part of the sea wall
OL,12,Fat Dawlish in Devon in February 2014,
OL,13,Fleaving rails hanging in mid-air and
OL,14,Fcutting off the line into the South
OL,15,FWest.
OL,17,FSince then, Network Rail has spent
OL,18,F#165m on improvements but work on a
OL,19,Fstretch of cliffs between Parson's
OL,20,FTunnel and Teignmouth has been put on
OL,21,Fhold because it is considered too
OL,22,Fexpensive.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
