OL,3,GNEWSA'Cliffs are enemy not the sea' for
OL,4,Arailway says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FTorbay Lib Dem MP Steve Darling told
OL,7,Fthe House of Commons the cliffs were
OL,8,F"the enemy now, rather than the sea",
OL,9,Fwhile transport minister Simon
OL,10,FLightwood said significant investment
OL,11,Fhad improved the line's resilience.
